tegrated Circuit) Tj-36 -24  TD /F1 9.96  Tf0.0135  Tc 2.555  Tw (The total cost of any product can be separated into two components: the recurring) Tj0 -12  TD 0.0167  Tc -0.0267  Tw (expenses or the ) Tj64.08 0  TD /F3 9.96  Tf0.0265  Tc 0.0035  Tw (variable cost) Tj51.96 0  TD /F1 9.96  Tf0.0162  Tc -0.0204  Tw (, and the non-recurring expenses or the ) Tj158.16 0  TD /F3 9.96  Tf0.0258  Tc 0.0042  Tw (fixed cost) Tj38.04 0  TD /F1 9.96  Tf0.03  Tc 0  Tw (. ) Tj-312.24 -24  TD /F0 9.96  Tf0.0181  Tc 0.0119  Tw (Fixed Cost) Tj0 -18  TD /F1 9.96  Tf0.0138  Tc -0.1118  Tw (The fixed cost is independent of the sales volume, the number of products sold. An impor-) Tj0 -12  TD 0.0144  Tc 1.1481  Tw (tant component of the fixed cost of an integrated circuit is the effort in time and man-) TjT* 0.0151  Tc 0.4149  Tw (power it takes to produce the design. This design cost is strongly influenced by the com-) TjT* 0.0142  Tc 0.3758  Tw (plexity of the design, the aggressiveness of the specifications, and the productivity of the) TjT* 0.0144  Tc -0.0389  Tw (designer. Advanced design methodologies that automate major parts of the design process) TjT* 0.0067  Tc 1.2158  Tw (can help to boost the latter. Bringing down the design cost in the presence of an ever-) TjT* 0.0128  Tc -0.1028  Tw (increasing IC complexity is one of the major challenges that is always facing the semicon-) TjT* 0.0089  Tc -0.0989  Tw (ductor industry.) Tj24 -12  TD 0.0184  Tc 0.6716  Tw (Additionally, one has to account for the) Tj0  Tc 0.03  Tw ( ) Tj165.96 0  TD /F3 9.96  Tf0.0257  Tc 0.6043  Tw (indirect costs) Tj54.24 0  TD /F1 9.96  Tf0.0097  Tc 0.7403  Tw (, the company overhead that) Tj-244.2 -12  TD 0.0203  Tc 2.5997  Tw (cannot be billed directly to one product. It includes amongst others the company\222s) Tj0 -12  TD 0.0114  Tc 0.1386  Tw (research and development \(R&D\), manufacturing equipment, marketing, sales, and build-) TjT* 0.0137  Tc 0.0163  Tw (ing infrastructure.) Tj0 -24  TD /F0 9.96  Tf0.0172  Tc 0.0128  Tw (Variable Cost) Tj0 -18  TD /F1 9.96  Tf0.0147  Tc 0.9324  Tw (This accounts for the cost that is directly attributable to a manufactured product, and is) Tj0 -12  TD 0.0183  Tc 1.1932  Tw (hence proportional to the product volume. Variable costs include the costs of the parts) TjT* 0.0155  Tc 0.4465  Tw (used in the product, assembly costs, and testing costs. The total cost of an integrated cir-) TjT* -0.0105  Tc 0.0405  Tw (cuit is now) Tj340.8 -26.52  TD -0  Tc 0  Tw (\(1.1\)) Tj-269.52 0  TD 0.0099  Tc 0.0201  Tw (cost per I) Tj15.6767  Tc 0  Tw (C) Tj0.0138  Tc 0.0162  Tw (variable cost per IC) Tj153.36 5.04  TD 0.023  Tc 0.007  Tw (fixed cost) Tj4.68 -12.24  TD 0.02  Tc 0  Tw (volume) Tj-4.68 7.2  TD -1.6538  Tc (---------------------) Tj-2.4767  Tc (--) Tj-4.68 -5.04  TD /F8 9.96  Tf39.9754  Tc (\350\370) Tj0 8.64  TD (\346\366) Tj-8.16 -3.6  TD /F1 9.96  Tf0.0226  Tc (+) Tj-91.68 0  TD (=) TjETq 18 728.52 27.12 0.84 re h W n 1 1 1 rg 9 729.36 m 9 728.64 l 45 728.64 l 45 729.36 l h fQ q 18 62.52 27.12 0.84 re h W n 1 1 1 rg 9 63.36 m 9 62.64 l 45 62.64 l 45 63.36 l h fQ q 567 62.52 27 0.84 re h W n 1 1 1 rg 567 63.36 m 567 62.64 l 603 62.64 l 603 63.36 l h fQ q 567 728.52 27 0.84 re h W n 1 1 1 rg 567 729.36 m 567 728.64 l 603 728.64 l 603 729.36 l h fQ 1 1 1 rg 53.64 738 0.72 36 re f557.64 738 0.72 36 re fq 557.64 18 0.84 36 re h W n 557.64 18 0.72 36 re fQ q 53.64 18 0.84 36 re h W n 53.64 18 0.72 36 re fQ q 18 728.76 27.12 0.36 re h W n 0 0 0 rg 9 729.12 m 9 728.88 l 45 728.88 l 45 729.12 l h fQ q 18 62.76 27.12 0.36 re h W n 0 0 0 rg 9 63.12 m 9 62.88 l 45 62.88 l 45 63.12 l h fQ q 567 62.76 27 0.36 re h W n 0 0 0 rg 567 63.12 m 567 62.88 l 603 62.88 l 603 63.12 l h fQ q 567 728.76 27 0.36 re h W n 0 0 0 rg 567 729.12 m 567 728.88 l 603 728.88 l 603 729.12 l h fQ 0 0 0 rg 53.88 738 0