e the actual voltage drops. For instance, it is not always easy to determine which) Tj0 -12  TD 0.0131  Tc 0.9031  Tw (way the current will flow when multiple parallel paths are available between the power) TjT* 0.0159  Tc 0.0055  Tw (source and the consuming gate. Also, currents into the different modules do rarely peak at) TjT* 0.0181  Tc 0.2888  Tw (the same time. All these considerations make the design of the power-distribution a chal-) TjT* 0.0139  Tc 2.2415  Tw (lenging job. It requires a design methodology approach that supersedes the artificial) TjT* 0.0135  Tc 0.0165  Tw (boundaries imposed by hierarchical design.) TjETq 143.88 237.84 360 0.36 re h W n 143.88 238.2 m 143.88 237.96 l 575.88 237.96 l 575.88 238.2 l h fQ BT167.88 220.92  TD0.0344  Tc 0  Tw (T) Tj6.12 0  TD 0.0169  Tc 0.7331  Tw (he purpose of this textbook is to provide) Tj0  Tc 0.03  Tw ( ) Tj169.8 0  TD /F3 9.96  Tf0.0234  Tc 0.7266  Tw (a bridge between the abstract vision of) Tj-199.92 -12  TD 0.0125  Tc -0.1959  Tw (digital design and the underlying digital circuit and its peculiarities) Tj270 0  TD /F1 9.96  Tf0.0075  Tc -0.2175  Tw (. While starting from a) Tj-270 -12  TD 0.0157  Tc 0.4112  Tw (solid understanding of the operation of electronic devices and an in-depth analysis of the) Tj0 -12  TD 0.013  Tc 1.133  Tw (nucleus of digital design\227the inverter\227we will gradually channel this knowledge into) TjT* 0.0128  Tc 0.3972  Tw (the design of more complex entities, such as complex gates, datapaths, registers, control-) TjT* 0.0139  Tc 0.4961  Tw (lers, and memories. The persistent quest for a designer when designing each of the men-) TjT* 0.0135  Tc 0.3936  Tw (tioned modules is to identify the dominant design parameters, to locate the section of the) TjT* 0.0139  Tc 0.3576  Tw (design he should focus his optimizations on, and to determine the specific properties that) TjT* 0.0123  Tc -0.0023  Tw (make the module under investigation \(e.g., a memor