.56 -12  TD 0.0187  Tc 0.4273  Tw (the internal details of a complex module can be abstracted away and replaced by a ) Tj338.4 0  TD /F3 9.96  Tf0.0293  Tc 0  Tw (black) Tj-338.4 -12  TD 0.0173  Tc 0.2527  Tw (box view ) Tj38.76 0  TD /F1 9.96  Tf0.0517  Tc 0  Tw (or) Tj8.28 0  TD /F3 9.96  Tf0.028  Tc 0.242  Tw ( model. ) Tj33 0  TD /F1 9.96  Tf0.0146  Tc 0.4954  Tw (This model contains virtually all the information needed to deal with) Tj-80.04 -12  TD 0.0154  Tc 0.4706  Tw (the block at the next level of hierarchy. For instance, once a designer has implemented ) Tj0.4978  Tc 0  Tw (a) Tj0 -12  TD 0.0101  Tc -0.2286  Tw (multiplier module, its performance can be defined very accurately and can be captured in a) TjT* 0.0215  Tc 0.1378  Tw (model. The performance of this multiplier is in general only marginally influenced by the) TjT* 0.0168  Tc 0.5356  Tw (way it is utilized in a larger system. For all purposes, it can hence be considered a black) TjT* 0.0162  Tc 2.5738  Tw (box with known characteristics. As there exists no compelling need for the system) TjT* 0.0114  Tc -0.0829  Tw (designer to look inside this box, design complexity is substantially reduced. The impact of) TjT* 0.002  Tc -0.092  Tw (this ) Tj17.4 0  TD /F3 9.96  Tf0.0124  Tc 0.4976  Tw (divide and conquer) Tj78.24 0  TD /F1 9.96  Tf0.0157  Tc 0.4743  Tw ( approach is dramatic. Instead of having to deal with a myriad of) Tj-95.64 -12  TD 0.0145  Tc 0.7697  Tw (elements, the designer has to consider only a handful of components, each of which are) Tj0 -12  TD 0.0116  Tc 0.0064  Tw (characterized in performance and cost by a small number of parameters.) Tj24 -12  TD 0.0161  Tc 0.0739  Tw (This is analogous to a software designer using a library of software routines such as) Tj-24 -12  TD 0.0129  Tc -0.2321  Tw (input/output drivers. Someone writing a large program does not bother to look inside those) Tj0 -12  TD 0.0149  Tc -0.1499  Tw (library routines. The only thing he cares about is the intended result of calling one of those) TjT* 0.0115  Tc 0.0871  Tw (modules. Imagine what writing software programs would be like if one had to fetch every) TjT* 0.0187  Tc 0.3799  Tw (bit individually from the disk and ensure its correctness instead of relying on handy \223file) TjT* 0.013  Tc 0.017  Tw (open\224 and \223get string\224 operators.) Tj209.64 383.4  TD /F4 7.92  Tf0.0075  Tc 0.0707  Tw (Figure 1.4) Tj39.96 0  TD /F5 7.92  Tf0.036  Tc 0.0422  Tw (Microprocessor performance ) TjETq 353.64 494.52 150.36 9.12 re h W n BT353.64 496.32  TD0.0335  Tc -0.0239  Tw (trends at the beginning of the 21st century.) TjETQ 1 1 1 rg 115.8 487.32 224.76 163.92 re fq 152.4 643.8 182.88 7.44 re h W n q 0.4 0.4 0.4 rg 335.16 645.96 m 152.4 773.88 l 152.4 771.84 l 335.16 643.92 l f*Q Q q 152.4 641.64 182.88 9.6 re h W n q 0.4 0.4 0.4 rg 335.16 643.92 m 152.4 771.84 l 152.4 769.68 l 335.16 641.76 l f*Q Q q 152.4 639.48 182.88 11.76 re h W n q 0.4 0.4 0.4 rg 335.16 641.76 m 152.4 769.68 l 152.4 767.52 l 335.16 639.6 l f*Q Q q 152.4 637.32 182.88 13.92 re h W n q 0.4039 0.4039 0.4039 rg 335.16 639.6 m 152.4 767.52 l 152.4 765.36 l 335.16 637.44 l f*Q Q q 152.4 635.28 182.88 15.96 re h W n q 0.4039 0.4039 0.4039 rg 335.16 637.44 m 152.4 765.36 l 152.4 763.32 l 335.16 635.4 l f*Q Q q 152.4 633.12 182.88 18.12 re h W n q 0.4078 0.4078 0.4078 rg 335.16 635.4 m 152.4 763.32 l 152.4 761.16 l 335.16 633.24 l f*Q Q q 152.4 630.96 182.88 20.28 re h W n q 0.4078 0.4078 0.4078 rg 335.16 633.24 m 152.4 761.16 l 152.4 759 l 335.16 631.08 l f*Q Q q 152.4 628.8 182.88 22.44 re h W n q 0.4118 0.4118 0.4118 rg 335.16 631.08 m 152.4 759 l 152.4 756.84 l 335.16 628.92 l f*Q Q q 152.4 626.76 182.88 24.48 re h W n q 0.4118 0.4118 0.4118 rg 335.16 628.92 m 152.4 756.84 l 152.4 754.8 l 335.16 626.88 l f*Q Q q 152.4 624.6 182.88 26.64 re h W n q 0.4157 0.4157 0.