e of presenting a perfect match in mechani-) TjT* 0.012  Tc 0.006  Tw (cal and thermal properties with respect to the die material. ) Tj24 -12  TD 0.0099  Tc -0.1499  Tw (The main advantages of the MCM approach are the increased packaging density and) Tj-24 -12  TD 0.0183  Tc 1.8662  Tw (performance. An example of an MCM module implemented using a silicon substrate) Tj0 -12  TD 0.0155  Tc -0.0455  Tw (\(commonly dubbed ) Tj80.28 0  TD /F3 9.96  Tf0.02  Tc 0  Tw (silicon-on-silicon) Tj69.96 0  TD /F1 9.96  Tf0.0189  Tc -0.1622  Tw (\) is shown in Figure 2.17. The module, which imple-) Tj-150.24 -12  TD 0.0124  Tc 0.1267  Tw (ments an avionics processor module and is fabricated by Rockwell International, contains) Tj0 -12  TD 0.0124  Tc 0.2726  Tw (53 ICs and 40 discrete devices on a 2.2) Tj158.4 0  TD /F4 9.96  Tf0.1392  Tc 0.1308  Tw (\262 \264) Tj12.36 0  TD /F1 9.96  Tf-0.03  Tc 0.3  Tw ( 2.2) Tj15.24 0  TD /F4 9.96  Tf-0.0136  Tc 0  Tw (\262) Tj4.2 0  TD /F1 9.96  Tf0.0176  Tc 0.2524  Tw ( substrate with aluminum polyimide inter-) Tj-190.2 -12  TD 0.0184  Tc 0.0116  Tw (connect. The interconnect wires are only an order of magnitude wider than what is typical) Tj0 -12  TD 0.015  Tc 0.0242  Tw (for on-chip wires, since similar patterning approaches are used. The module itself has 180) TjT* 0.0138  Tc 1.29  Tw (I/O pins. Performance is improved by the elimination of the chip-carrier layer with its) TjT* 0.0151  Tc -0.1611  Tw (assorted parasitics, and through a reduction of the global wiring lengths on the die, a result) TjT* 0.0145  Tc 0.8924  Tw (of the increased packaging density. For instance, a solder bump has an assorted capaci-) TjT* 0.0171  Tc 0.2615  Tw (tance and inductance of only 0.1 pF and 0.01 nH respectively. The MCM technology can) TjT* 0.0186  Tc 0.6647  Tw (also reduce power consumption significantly, since large output drivers\227and associated) TjT* 0.0171  Tc 0.3947  Tw (dissipation\227become superfluous due to the reduced load capacitance of the output pads.) Tj1 1 1 rg ET193.08 597.72 m 192.96 598.68 l 192.36 599.4 l 191.52 600 l 190.56 600.12 l 189.6 600 l 188.76 599.4 l 188.28 598.68 l 188.04 597.72 l 188.28 596.76 l 188.76 595.92 l 189.6 595.44 l 190.56 595.2 l 191.52 595.44 l 192.36 595.92 l 192.96 596.76 l 193.08 597.72 l h f*0 0 0 rg 192.84 597.72 m 192.72 598.68 l 192.84 598.44 l 192.24 599.16 l 191.4 599.76 l 191.52 599.76 l 190.56 599.88 l 189.6 599.76 l 189.72 599.76 l 188.88 599.16 l 189 599.28 l 188.52 598.56 l 188.28 597.6 l 188.28 597.72 l 188.52 596.76 l 188.52 596.88 l 189 596.04 l 188.88 596.04 l 189.72 595.56 l 189.72 595.68 l 190.68 595.44 l 190.56 595.44 l 191.52 595.68 l 191.4 595.56 l 192.24 596.04 l 192.84 596.88 l 192.72 596.76 l 192.84 597.72 l 193.32 597.72 l 193.2 596.76 l 193.2 596.64 l 192.6 595.8 l 192.48 595.68 l 191.64 595.2 l 190.68 594.96 l 190.56 594.96 l 189.6 595.2 l 189.48 595.2 l 188.64 595.68 l 188.64 595.8 l 188.16 596.64 l 188.04 596.64 l 187.8 597.6 l 187.8 597.72 l 188.04 598.68 l 188.16 598.8 l 188.64 599.52 l 189.48 600.12 l 189.6 600.24 l 190.56 600.36 l 191.52 600.24 l 191.64 600.12 l 192.48 599.52 l 192.6 599.52 l 193.2 598.8 l 193.2 598.68 l 193.32 597.72 l h f192.84 597.72 m 193.32 597.72 l h f1 1 1 rg 200.16 597.72 m 200.04 598.68 l 199.44 599.4 l 198.6 600 l 197.64 600.12 l 196.68 600 l 195.84 599.4 l 195.36 598.68 l 195.12 597.72 l 195.36 596.76 l 195.84 595.92 l 196.68 595.44 l 197.64 595.2 l 198.6 595.44 l 199.44 595.92 l 200.04 596.76 l 200.16 597.72 l h f*0 0 0 rg 199.92 597.72 m 199.8 598.68 l 199.92 598.44 l 199.32 599.16 l 198.48 599.76 l 198.6 599.76 l 197.64 599.88 l 196.68 599.76 l 196.8 599.76 l 195.96 599.16 l 196.08 599.28 l 195.6 598.56 l 195.36 597.6 l 195.36 597.72 l 195.6 596.76 l 195.6 596.88 l 196.08 596.04 l 195.96 596.04 l 196.8 595.56 l 196.8 595.68 l 197.76 595.44 l 197.64 595.