n, it is actu-) TjT* 0.0174  Tc -0.0194  Tw (ally possible to speed up the inverter by reducing the width of the PMOS device! ) TjETq 18 728.52 27.12 0.84 re h W n 1 1 1 rg 9 729.36 m 9 728.64 l 45 728.64 l 45 729.36 l h fQ q 18 62.52 27.12 0.84 re h W n 1 1 1 rg 9 63.36 m 9 62.64 l 45 62.64 l 45 63.36 l h fQ q 567 62.52 27 0.84 re h W n 1 1 1 rg 567 63.36 m 567 62.64 l 603 62.64 l 603 63.36 l h fQ q 567 728.52 27 0.84 re h W n 1 1 1 rg 567 729.36 m 567 728.64 l 603 728.64 l 603 729.36 l h fQ 1 1 1 rg 53.64 738 0.72 36 re f557.64 738 0.72 36 re fq 557.64 18 0.84 36 re h W n 557.64 18 0.72 36 re fQ q 53.64 18 0.84 36 re h W n 53.64 18 0.72 36 re fQ q 18 728.76 27.12 0.36 re h W n 0 0 0 rg 9 729.12 m 9 728.88 l 45 728.88 l 45 729.12 l h fQ q 18 62.76 27.12 0.36 re h W n 0 0 0 rg 9 63.12 m 9 62.88 l 45 62.88 l 45 63.12 l h fQ q 567 62.76 27 0.36 re h W n 0 0 0 rg 567 63.12 m 567 62.88 l 603 62.88 l 603 63.12 l h fQ q 567 728.76 27 0.36 re h W n 0 0 0 rg 567 729.12 m 567 728.88 l 603 728.88 l 603 729.12 l h fQ 0 0 0 rg 53.88 738 0.24 36 re f557.88 738 0.24 36 re fq 557.88 18 0.36 36 re h W n 557.88 18 0.24 36 re fQ q 53.88 18 0.36 36 re h W n 53.88 18 0.24 36 re fQ BT78 741  TD/F2 6.96  Tf0.0166  Tc -0.0221  Tw (chapter5.fm  Page 199  Friday, January 18, 2002  9:01 AM) Tj1 1 1 rg ET42 396 m 41.88 397.2 l 41.52 398.28 l 40.92 399.36 l 40.2 400.2 l 39.36 400.92 l 38.28 401.52 l 37.2 401.88 l 36 402 l 34.8 401.88 l 33.6 401.52 l 32.64 400.92 l 31.8 400.2 l 30.96 399.36 l 30.48 398.28 l 30.12 397.2 l 30 396 l 30.12 394.8 l 30.48 393.72 l 30.96 392.64 l 31.8 391.8 l 32.64 391.08 l 33.6 390.48 l 34.8 390.12 l 36 390 l 37.2 390.12 l 38.28 390.48 l 39.36 391.08 l 40.2 391.8 l 40.92 392.64 l 41.52 393.72 l 41.88 394.8 l 42 396 l h f*0 0 0 rg 41.88 396 m 41.76 397.2 l 41.76 397.08 l 41.4 398.16 l 40.8 399.24 l 40.08 400.08 l 40.2